# Risk Register Summary

Sanitized summary of risk register entries maintained in this lab's GRC platform (Eramba). Full tracking — including remediation ownership and internal notes — is maintained privately; this document reflects the substance of each entry for portfolio purposes. Structure follows standard risk register practice (NIST SP 800-30 / ISO 27005 format: identification, assessment, treatment, residual risk, review cycle).

All entries sourced from real, credentialed Nessus vulnerability scans against the lab's AD_LAB segment (Phase 2, Entry 005), not synthetic or hypothetical findings.

